</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I love the Church, O God!</l><l>Her walls before Thee stand,</l><l>Dear as the apple of Thine eye</l><l>And graven on Thy hand.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>For her my tears shall fall,</l><l>For her my prayers ascend;</l><l>To her my cares and toils be given</l><l>Till toils and cares shall end.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Beyond my highest joy</l><l>I prize her heavenly ways,</l><l>Her sweet communion, solemn vows,</l><l>Her hymns of love and praise.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Sure as Thy truth shall last,</l><l>To Zion shall be given</l><l>The brightest glories earth can yield,</l><l>And brighter bliss of heaven.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
